ite.long.record-257bm-i-mob"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-i-mob"],"id":"long.record-257bm-i-mob","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.106 (Möbius inversion of the divisor counts)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.106, p. 74, label record:257bm-i-mob","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For a set $A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}$ and each positive integer $n$,\n$$\n\\sum_{d\\mid n}\\mu(d)c_A(n/d)=\\mathbf1_A(n),\n$$\nwhere $\\mu$ is the Möbius function and $c_A(n)$ counts the positive elements of $A$ dividing $n$. Thus the divisor counts determine the positive support exactly. In particular their Möbius transform takes only the values $0$ and $1$. The identity does not depend on a base.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-i-mob","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-i-mob","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i-mob%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.mobius_supportCoeff_boolean%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i-mob%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.mobius_supportCoeff_boolean%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.mobius_supportCoeff_boolean"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-i-mob","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i-mob%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.mobius_supportCoeff_eq_one_iff%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c